    "excerpt": "A Windows multi-bash plugin for DeepSeek Harness: the gitbash / wslbash model tools, each owning its own Git Bash / WSL executor. The plugin never touches the ctx.shell seat — dsh's own pwsh executor keeps it — so pwsh behavior is identical to a deployment without the plugin."
